比例及风险导向监查触发条件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_monitoring_frequency","missing_source_classes":["项目监查计划","风险导向监查策略文件"],"target":"12.2节监查频率与范围条款"},{"action":"补充监查发现分级、纠正预防措施跟踪及向申办者医学部门升级的路径","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_monitoring_escalation","missing_source_classes":["监查报告模板及升级路径SOP"],"target":"12.2节监查发现处理与升级条款"}],"heading":"监查","missing_source_classes":["项目监查计划","风险导向监查策略文件","监查报告模板及升级路径SOP"],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、三臂平行剂量探索Ⅱ期临床研究，计划入组180例受试者，涉及多个研究中心。监查工作由申办者或其委托的代理人执行，属于项目管理与研究管理的职能范畴。监查的目的是确保各研究中心按照本方案、药物临床试验质量管理规范及适用法规要求开展研究，保障受试者权益与数据完整性。监查员在每次访视中应核查知情同意签署情况、受试者入组资格、研究药物发放与回收记录、咳嗽监测设备使用与数据下载、电子日记依从性、不良事件及合并用药记录、实验室与心电图检查完成情况，以及源文件与电子数据采集系统之间的一致性。鉴于本研究采用双盲设计且涉及客观咳嗽频率监测与主观量表评估，监查员应特别关注盲态维持措施的执行情况，包括双模拟药物的外观一致性、随机化系统的操作合规性以及咳嗽监测设备校准记录的完整性。各研究中心应配合监查员查阅与本研究相关的源文件，监查员应记录监查发现并与研究者沟通纠正措施。","rationale":"多中心三臂设计及180例样本量来自当前项目已确认研究事实；监查职能归属来自公司语料CMD-D001-AD方案12.4管理结构章节（仅用于职能框架措辞参照）。具体监查频率、风险导向监查策略、远程监查比例、监查报告模板及升级路径缺少本项目监查计划来源，需医学经理补充确认。咳嗽监测设备与电子日记的监查关注点基于项目访视策略中设备发放与数据采集安排推导，需确认是否纳入监查核查清单。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_e909147e5fe846ac","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51c9adbcd42883fa2b19375a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ec8b4a462fef49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:371c2c1c6a800d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006073033_86ad836f","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充本项目稽查计划，明确稽查职能归属、稽查频率、稽查范围（数据完整性、知情同意、药物管理、安全性报告等）及稽查报告分发路径","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_audit_plan","missing_source_classes":["项目稽查计划","独立稽查职能设置文件"],"target":"12.3节稽查计划与范围"},{"action":"补充研究中心配合国家或省级药品监督管理部门核查的流程、通知时限、文件准备要求及核查发现响应机制","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_inspection_cooperation","missing_source_classes":["监管核查配合流程SOP"],"target":"12.3节监管核查配合条款"}],"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":["项目稽查计划","独立稽查职能设置文件","监管核查配合流程SOP","稽查发现跟踪与关闭机制"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源中无任何直接涉及稽查职能设置、稽查频率与范围、核查配合流程或稽查发现跟踪机制的内容。公司语料CMD-D001-AD的12.4管理结构章节仅提及项目管理与监查职能，未涉及独立稽查或监管核查配合条款。当前项目研究事实中亦未包含稽查或核查相关安排。本章节无法形成有实质信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_5bac12ed9bbcc02f","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51c9adbcd42883fa2b19375a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ec8b4a462fef49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:371c2c1c6a800d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006073033_86ad836f","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:12.2 方案偏离|block:952|chunk:1","quote":"申办者将审查所有方案偏离，并评估是否有严重违背GCP，以及是否要求向卫生主管部门报告。","quote_sha256":"d25517b45959baef1238950be1f20302bb12ced5e0f13f47f237db01e4ef9d8a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:371c2c1c6a800d","span_id":"es_002"},{"locator":"section:12.2 方案偏离|block:952|chunk:1","quote":"根据申办者的要求或SOP，偏离方案的前瞻性请求，包括放弃方案合格性标准的请求将不会被允许。","quote_sha256":"8b5479c25517a02284beffcbf64c724fda48c3b021d1d86e622a7400e29e5fb6","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:371c2c1c6a800d","span_id":"es_003"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_002","es_003"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充本项目方案偏离分类标准（重大/一般/轻微）、各级偏离的报告时限、伦理委员会通知路径及数据库锁定前偏离汇总审查流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_deviation_classification","missing_source_classes":["项目方案偏离管理SOP","偏离分类标准与报告时限规定"],"target":"12.4节偏离分类与报告时限条款"},{"action":"补充严重偏离对受试者数据在主要分析中的处理规则及敏感性分析触发条件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_deviation_impact","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划中偏离处理条款"],"target":"12.4节偏离对数据处理影响条款"}],"heading":"方案偏离","missing_source_classes":["项目方案偏离管理SOP","偏离分类标准与报告时限规定","伦理委员会通知路径文件"],"proposal_text":"方案偏离是指研究中心或研究者在研究实施过程中未遵循本方案已明确规定的程序、标准或要求的情形。申办者将审查所有方案偏离，并评估是否有严重违背GCP，以及是否要求向卫生主管部门报告。根据申办者的要求或SOP，偏离方案的前瞻性请求，包括放弃方案合格性标准的请求将不会被允许。本研究中，方案偏离的识别、记录与报告由研究中心负责，研究者应在发现偏离后及时记录于电子数据采集系统或相应记录表格中，并通知申办者或其监查员。申办者对偏离进行分级评估，判断其对受试者安全性、数据完整性及研究科学性的影响程度。对于可能影响主要终点数据完整性或受试者安全的偏离，申办者应评估是否需要在统计分析中对该受试者数据进行敏感性分析处理。各研究中心应配合申办者完成偏离的汇总审查，确保在数据库锁定前完成所有已知偏离的评估与关闭。","rationale":"方案偏离审查主体、GCP严重违背评估及前瞻性偏离禁止条款来自公司语料CMD-D001-AD方案12.2方案偏离章节（仅用于监管共性结构参照）。本章节未写入具体偏离分类标准（重大/一般/轻微）、报告时限、伦理委员会通知路径及严重偏离对受试者数据处理的具体规则，因缺少本项目方案偏离管理SOP来源。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_76c300b6a61ff710","section_number":"12.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51c9adbcd42883fa2b19375a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ec8b4a462fef49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:371c2c1c6a800d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006073033_86ad836f","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:12.4 管理结构|block:957|chunk:1","quote":"申办者或其代理人将执行项目管理、研究管理、监查、供应商管理和统计编程。","quote_sha256":"5834095b23bbc6d48489fa3422974312fd017a35e751e85cb64acbf9efdf593c","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ec8b4a462fef49","span_id":"es_001"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、三臂平行剂量探索Ⅱ期","quote_sha256":"ba2f3a9609a0a49d52fbc30fd0a42f10e4ce9f5d15c659d1c9e466207d903103","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"section:12.4 管理结构|block:957|chunk:1","quote":"可使用IWRS进行参与者筛查和随机分组，以及研究药物申请和运输的管理。研究中心将负责生物样品在运输至申办者或其指定分析单位之前的保存。数据将使用eCRFs通过EDC系统记录，或以电子方式转发给申办者（例如，药代动力学数据）。","quote_sha256":"4cfe639a26124187ed661654b28a04c5759f3da872955ea4e8e4ba2608b51a01","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ec8b4a462fef49","span_id":"es_006"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_004","es_006"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充本项目具体角色清单（医学监查员、数据管理员、统计师、药物管理员、中心协调员、咳嗽监测设备技术支持等）及各角色职责边界与汇报关系","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_role_definitions","missing_source_classes":["项目组织管理架构文件","各角色职责说明书"],"target":"12.5节角色与职责条款"},{"action":"明确本项目供应商管理范围（咳嗽监测设备供应商、电子日记平台、中心实验室、电子数据采集系统、IWRS等）及各供应商的资质要求与监督机制","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_vendor_scope","missing_source_classes":["供应商管理范围清单"],"target":"12.5节供应商管理条款"},{"action":"补充多中心协调机制，包括中心启动培训、研究者会议、多中心数据一致性核查及中心间沟通路径","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_multicenter_coordination","missing_source_classes":["多中心协调机制文件"],"target":"12.5节多中心协调条款"}],"heading":"关键角色和研究管理","missing_source_classes":["项目组织管理架构文件","各角色职责说明书","供应商管理范围清单","多中心协调机制文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究的组织管理由申办者统筹，申办者或其代理人负责执行项目管理、研究管理、监查、供应商管理和统计编程等职能。本研究为多中心设计，计划入组180例受试者，采用三臂平行剂量探索设计，涉及咳嗽监测设备发放与回收、电子日记数据采集、双模拟药物管理及多中心随机化等协调工作。研究中心负责在研究药物运输至申办者或其指定分析单位之前对生物样品进行保存，数据通过电子数据采集系统记录或以电子方式转发给申办者。各研究中心的主要研究者对研究在本中心的实施承担总体责任，包括确保研究团队理解并遵循本方案、保障受试者权益与安全、确保数据真实完整及配合监查与稽查。申办者应指定项目管理团队负责多中心协调、供应商管理（包括咳嗽监测设备供应商、中心实验室、电子数据采集系统供应商等）及统计编程工作。","rationale":"项目管理、研究管理、监查、供应商管理和统计编程的职能框架来自公司语料CMD-D001-AD方案12.4管理结构章节（仅用于监管共性结构参照）。多中心三臂设计及180例样本量来自当前项目已确认研究事实。咳嗽监测设备与电子日记来自项目访视策略。本章节未写入具体角色清单（如医学监查员、数据管理员、药物管理员、中心协调员等）及各角色职责边界，因缺少本项目组织管理架构文件来源。IWRS、EDC等技术平台描述来自CMD-D001-AD项目，是否适用于本项目需确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_f483e1f70b6bfd00","section_number":"12.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51c9adbcd42883fa2b19375a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ec8b4a462fef49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:371c2c1c6a800d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"82f22f92fd856b70d23406e44985454cc2d74dd02d13e6454042159005b1f7c5","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_246db92c9af41aa3:full-draft:51c9adbcd42883fa2b19375a","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:51c9adbcd42883fa2b19375a","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:cef2e5b7988d9864d1b98dfb0bc95e057f2c396180e4f95d9f038e0de4071b58:51c9adbcd42883fa2b19375a","text_sha256":"82f22f92fd856b70d23406e44985454cc2d74dd02d13e6454042159005b1f7c5"},{"content_sha256":"01fb60f91790159b3d342d91540f420017aa470272eae36591eeb66d47b33be7","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","text_sha256":"01fb60f91790159b3d342d91540f420017aa470272eae36591eeb66d47b33be7"},{"content_sha256":"6c7271f4ed3fd8fedd8e75159484480005fc72345847383d098e28d5130237d6","locator":"section:12.4 管理结构|block:957|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ec8b4a462fef49","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"ec8b4a462fef49","text_sha256":"6c7271f4ed3fd8fedd8e75159484480005fc72345847383d098e28d5130237d6"},{"content_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"342cfc57d67b67","text_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd"},{"content_sha256":"643056aa94c1285201b5f63d6801971893fb90935354b44c77e0839ffc32b390","locator":"section:12.2 方案偏离|block:952|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:371c2c1c6a800d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"371c2c1c6a800d","text_sha256":"643056aa94c1285201b5f63d6801971893fb90935354b44c77e0839ffc32b390"},{"content_sha256":"33118fc6958419e645c6a0a19471c78f80e0c4c28be03b46f2b3e61d287e0305","locator":"section:文档开头|block:26|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"63ce4061f946ca","text_sha256":"33118fc6958419e645c6a0a19471c78f80e0c4c28be03b46f2b3e61d287e0305"},{"content_sha256":"8057617d1964e3423a8b531b36e60104d5287e4d9023114f9c3ff9663a282c5f","locator":"section:研究方案|block:3|chunk: